Dear Brightwell team,

We produce glassware in Guadalajara and decorate for The Mahjong Social Club line. Our quotation for you (photos attached):

1. TU7P9EGSC - "Prosperity" pint glass, 16 oz. USD 2.60 / pc. MOQ 500 pcs. Production 45 days, transit to US warehouse 25 days.
2. TUPX9EGSC - "Mahj Happy Hour" pint glass, 16 oz. USD 2.15 / pc. MOQ 100 cartons. Production 35 days, transit 30 days.
3. WGTDZEGSC - "Deal Me In" stemless wine glass, 17 oz. USD 2.40 / pc. MOQ 1,000 pcs. Production 55 days, transit 30 days.

Specifications
- Pint glasses: 3.5 x 3.5 x 5.88 in, weight 0.81 lb (367 g). Soda-lime glass.
- Stemless wine glass: 3.5 x 3.5 x 4.5 in, weight 0.42 lb (190 g). Soda-lime glass.
- Dishwasher safe (top rack) and microwave safe.
- Sold open stock with UPC sticker. Artwork by EveArt.
- Glass made in Mexico, decoration and final assembly in the USA.
- Incoterm FCA Guadalajara. Payment 50% deposit.
- Samples: 3 free pieces per design.

Atentamente,
Carlos Mendoza
Casa Vidrio Guadalajara S.A. de C.V.

